      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sweet jesus i have been troubleshooting this for days i thought i was losing my mind. Realtime lighting is borked in these worlds i am on 2022.3.22f1 and using the newest beta VRchat and current production build with the same issues. I have a pic of me sitting in front of the furry hideouts realtime lighting in front of the mirror. It is affecting any avatar i try it on. This is affecting PC worlds aswell.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
